{"seq":7,"slug":"constitutional-law","title":"宪法学","stage":"DONE","category":"law-legal","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 宪法学 简介\n\n宪法是一个国家的根本大法，它规定了国家的基本制度、公民的基本权利以及国家权力的组织和运行方式。宪法学则是以宪法及其实施为研究对象的法学分支，是理解一切部门法和国家治理体系的基础。对于技术从业者而言，理解宪法学有助于把握言论自由、隐私权、平等权等与技术发展密切相关的基本权利的法律边界。\n\n本知识库面向具有一定法律基础知识、希望系统了解宪法制度和原理的中级程序员和技术人员。如果你对数据隐私保护的宪法依据感到好奇，或者希望理解不同国家政治体制差异背后的宪法逻辑，本知识库将为你提供清晰的理论框架。\n\n第1章**宪法基本理论**从宪法的概念和本质出发，系统讲解宪法的历史演变、基本原则以及宪法的分类与特征，帮助你建立对宪法作为根本法的整体认知。\n\n第2章**公民基本权利**聚焦于宪法最核心的价值内容，涵盖基本权利的体系与分类、自由权利、平等权利以及社会权利，这些内容是理解宪政制度存在意义的关键。\n\n第3章**国家机构与权力分立**深入分析国家权力的组织形式，包括立法机关、行政机关、司法机关的职权划分以及权力制衡机制，帮助你理解不同国家政治体制的运作逻辑。\n\n第4章**违宪审查制度**探讨宪法实施的保障机制，涵盖司法审查的理论基础、宪法法院制度、宪法诉愿以及宪法解释方法，展示宪法如何从纸面上的条文转化为对权力的实际约束。\n\n建议学习路径为：先完成第一章建立宪法学的基本概念框架，再学习第二章理解宪法保障的核心价值，第三章和第四章可根据兴趣选择顺序。建议在学习过程中对比不同国家的宪法制度以拓宽视野。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"constitutional-theory","title":"宪法基本理论","docCount":4,"url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"constitution-concept","title":"宪法的概念与特征","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-theory/constitution-concept"},{"seq":2,"slug":"constitutional-history","title":"宪法史：从限权契约到根本法","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-theory/constitutional-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"constitutional-principles","title":"宪法基本原则","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-theory/constitutional-principles"},{"seq":4,"slug":"constitutional-types","title":"宪法分类","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-theory/constitutional-types"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"fundamental-rights","title":"公民基本权利","docCount":4,"url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/fundamental-rights","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rights-overview","title":"基本权利概论","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/fundamental-rights/rights-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"freedom-rights","title":"自由权","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/fundamental-rights/freedom-rights"},{"seq":3,"slug":"equality-rights","title":"平等权","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/fundamental-rights/equality-rights"},{"seq":4,"slug":"social-rights","title":"社会权利","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/fundamental-rights/social-rights"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"state-structure","title":"国家机构与权力分立","docCount":4,"url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/state-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legislative-organ","title":"立法机关","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/state-structure/legislative-organ"},{"seq":2,"slug":"executive-organ","title":"行政机关","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/state-structure/executive-organ"},{"seq":3,"slug":"judicial-organ","title":"司法机关","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/state-structure/judicial-organ"},{"seq":4,"slug":"power-balance","title":"权力制衡","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/state-structure/power-balance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"constitutional-review","title":"违宪审查制度","docCount":4,"url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"judicial-review","title":"违宪审查","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-review/judicial-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"constitutional-court","title":"宪法法院","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-review/constitutional-court"},{"seq":3,"slug":"constitutional-complaint","title":"宪法诉愿","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-review/constitutional-complaint"},{"seq":4,"slug":"constitutional-interpretation","title":"宪法解释","url":"/h/law-legal/constitutional-law/constitutional-review/constitutional-interpretation"}]}]}